.TH SOCKETPAIR 3
.SH NAME
socketpair \- libc wrapper for a connected local socket pair
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <sys/socket.h>
.PP
.B int socketpair(int domain, int type, int protocol, int sv[2]);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The libc wrapper submits the native socketpair operation and translates a
negative Astia ABI result into -1 with errno. Only AF_UNIX SOCK_STREAM pairs
are currently provided.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero on success and fills sv[0] and sv[1], or returns -1 on error.
